PRO-FORMA FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION
RESOLVED that the Articles of Incorporation for the Unlimited Liability Corporation be adopted in the form presented, authorizing the incorporation of [Company Name] under the Business Corporations Act (Alberta);
RESOLVED that the registered office of the Corporation be established at [Full Address], Alberta, Canada, and that [Name] be appointed as the first director and officer who shall also serve as the incorporator's representative;
RESOLVED that the initial share structure consist of no par value shares, with the incorporator subscribing to one share at nominal value, and that all shares be issued as non-voting unless otherwise resolved;
RESOLVED that the corporate banking and accounting records be maintained at the registered office, and that the Corporation's books be opened immediately upon issuance of the Certificate of Incorporation;
RESOLVED FURTHER that these resolutions are effective upon the issuance of the Certificate of Incorporation, and that the Secretary be authorized to execute all necessary documents.
